Dietary Calorie Intake & Nutrition Log System (NutriTrack)

Academic Project - B.Tech CSE (IoT) 3rd Semester
Author: Purushottam

Build & Run Instructions:
- Double-click `run.bat` to launch the application.
- Double-click `build.bat` to recompile source files.
- Double-click `test.bat` to run the 39 automated unit tests.
- Alternatively, use Maven: `mvn clean compile exec:java`.

Architecture:
- Core Java 17+ (Java Swing Desktop GUI)
- Layered Model-View-Service Pattern
- Local Persistent Storage: data/ (Serialization)
- Zero external jar dependencies required.
